+# V2 finite operational delta, source-only and NOT activated
+
+Supersedes V1 only for H1-H3 and final overlay checks. No architecture, image, source, candidate, offlineFS11, compiler or testoracle change. No extraction/network/probe/service/npm/compiler/test effects executed. AST and byte comparisons only. V1 review context follows below; these corrections replace its operational details where narrower.
+
+## H1 durable own-resource custody and uncertain commands
+
+network constructor writes a root0600/fsync/atomic ledger BEFORE kernelnetworkeffects, containing exact randomtag/namespace/veth/table IDs and preflightabsence result. producer durably stores exact networkledger/unit/unitfile/hash before the first network mutation. Every ip/nft mutation records ATTEMPTED_RESULT_UNKNOWN BEFORE command and acknowledgement only after return. Namespaceadd is inside setup try. Listener bindattempt is recorded too, with processFD-only lifetime. Unit write/start/reload/stop/remount commands have durable attempts; assemblytmpfsmount also records priorattempt and reconciles actualmountinfo on error instead of trusting mountedboolean.
+
+Cleanup no longer depends on created/hosttable flags. It queries ALL exact reservedidentifiers, checks namespaceinode/vethifindex/nfttablehandle where already acquired, attempts removal when a command may have landed but did not acknowledge, and verifies table/ns/bothlinknames absent. It never sweeps byprefix. Preflightcollision before any mutation returns noowned-effect; it does not delete colliding foreignresources. Ledger records actualcleanupfailures and UNKNOWN, even if a later lookup is empty. A mismatched acquiredidentity prevents deletion and remains UNKNOWN.
+
+recover(ledgerpath) and reconcile_owned(closeoutpath,approvedSHA,reviewroot) are explicit finite recovery entries for interrupted proposed runs. Rootprivate custody and exact own paths/tag/hash required, stale interruptedpendingledger preserved separately; exactunit is stopped/reconciled and exactnetworkledger consulted without relying on stale booleans. Recovery NEVER yields validationPASS and retains data until VMteardown if terminalcustody is not complete. No future daemon/monitor introduced.
+
+## H2 own-interface NAT and actual host/namespace evidence
+
+MASQUERADE now requires iifname exactly ownedhostveth in addition to ownsource/finitepublic443. HosttableJSON is read from real nft, including acquiredtablehandle; before/afterprobe snapshots include BOTH host/nsrulesets, ownhostroutes, namespaceroutes, host/peerlinkdetails, namespace+hostnetnsinodes and observedforwarding1. Compare stablecontents acrossprobe excluding only packet/byte/handle counters (tablehandle checked separately), fail on topology/rulechange. No globalforwarding or firewallchain changes. Textreadback is still insufficient: controlledlistener baseline+childdeny/counterdelta+verifiedTLSpositive remains required before npm.
+
+## H3 real socket-family oracle and remaining budgets
+
+Readback now REQUIRES RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_INET and SystemCallArchitectures=native before probepermit. Gate closes all possible nonstdioFDs first. Prohibitedsocket tests use valid family/type/protocol combinations: UNIX/STREAM, INET6/STREAM, PACKET/DGRAM/ETH_P_ALL and NETLINK/RAW/NETLINK_ROUTE. ALL require exact EAFNOSUPPORT97, not anyerror. This distinguishes missingCAP_NET_RAW/invalidSOCK_STREAM failures from filterdenial. Allowed AF_INET/STREAM must create successfully. Host verifies exact4testtuples and errno receipt, not just count. No hostsocket inherited or delivered.
+
+Host9secondbudget now passed through confirm_probe→every nft/ip readback/route/link command and listeneraccept; each command gets min(5s,remaining) and postreturndeadlinecheck, no cumulative newbudget. ChildpublicTLSprobe connects/requests/readsstatus with remaining8secondtimeouts and closes without unboundedbodyread. Final context/deadline/continuity check before atomic npmpermission unchanged. Timeout is failurefallback, not evidence of filterenforcement.
+
+## Effective OCI overlays
+
+Before extraction, MODE/OWNER overlay JSON must equal EXACTLY the mapping derived from pinnedinventory, including all16modes/33owners and exactbefore/after. Final everyentry readback now checks TYPE and UID=GID0 as well as modes/bytes/hash/linktarget; directories and hardlinks have explicit checks, hardlinksameinode. Exactpathset/noattrs retained. A derivedeffective-manifest with kind/mode/uid/gid/bytesidentity/linkidentity is emitted and hashbound in rootfsreceipt and preparationclosure. No hidden bytechanges or ownershipnormalization beyond declaredoverlay.
+
+Remaining state unchanged: this is a proposal for independent review, no evidence that probes/fulltypes work. ip_forwardalready1, standardtools/nft/namespace support, reservedprefixfree, imageclosure/layerssealed and diskbudget remain real preconditions, not assumptions confirmed by this work. No launcher/offlinehandoff activation/upload. No fresh OCI research or broader containmentframework. All new recovery/probe entries are code only, not permission to run them.
+
+---
